  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Heaven Extremity is the leader of the eight Gu Immortals operating Calamity Luck Altar. He urges Five Elements Grandmaster to surrender until the Four Desolation Immortals awaken, and boasts that Calamity Luck Altar can reverse calamity and luck so the invasion becomes nourishment for Longevity Heaven. Five Elements Grandmaster answers that the Eight Extremities have not broken the first layer of his five elements ring despite using Longevity Heaven’s might.",
      "chapters": [
        1180
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "fac_four_desolations",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "fac_eight_extremities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Extremity rejects Five Elements Grandmaster’s call to merge lone immortals and demonic cultivators like Gong tribe, laughs that the Huang Jin tribes and Ancestor Giant Sun are not to be looked down on, and insists Northern Plains’ righteous path are the Huang Jin tribes while scorning Bai Zu tribe’s bloodline claim.",
      "chapters": [
        1181
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "huang-jin-stance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gong_tribe",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Longevity Heaven’s Eight Extremities are eight rank seven Gu Immortals; Heaven Extremity leads them and Earth Extremity is second-in-charge. When ringing alarm bell sounds, Heaven Extremity says they will follow South Desolation Immortal to obtain love Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1238
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "roster-rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_earth_extremity",
        "char_south_desolation_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When South Desolation Immortal orders Black Extremity to prepare to move, Black Extremity and Flood Extremity separate from the Eight Extremities besieging Five Elements Grandmaster at Calamity Luck Altar. Heaven Extremity tells the pair to come back quickly and does not dare to divide his own attention any further. Two rank sevens short, the Extremities left at the altar are more helpless than before against Five Elements Grandmaster, and can only hold the situation as it stands while they wait for the two to come back.",
      "chapters": [
        1267
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "two-extremities-dispatched",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sun_ming_lu",
        "char_flood_extremity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Luck Suppression Heavenly Palace in Savage Wilderness Great World, Bing Sai Chuan wakes a fatty asleep on the table with saliva on his sleeves. That fatty is Heaven Extremity Gai Mei, a wisdom path Gu Immortal Bing Sai Chuan asks to deduce Longevity Heaven’s next move after Fang Yuan and Lu Wei Yin appear in Yellow Earth Great World. An information path Immortal Gu lands on Gai Mei’s head; he reads it without touching it and notes that his earlier deductions about Fang Yuan’s arrival were correct, then pretends to deduce with five fat fingers before admitting the act. He refuses to activate a real deduction killer move because it is too tiring, suggests asking their lord ancestor instead, and complains that others forced the Heaven Extremity title on him when he did not want it. Yellow Extremity Jiao Huo urges Brother Gai to help, but Gai Mei rolls his eyes, says Heavenly Court is better at deductions under Star Constellation Immortal Venerable, and goes back to sleep on the table.",
      "chapters": [
        2156
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-as-gai-mei",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_luck_suppression_heavenly_palace",
        "loc_savage_wilderness_great_world",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "loc_yellow_earth_great_world",
        "char_jiao_huo",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s force grows unexpected, Heaven Extremity Gai Mei drinks wine and eats snacks while insisting his previous plan and deduction were not wrong. He tells Bing Sai Chuan that Savage Wilderness Great World lacks a proper relationship to its inhabitants because Reckless Savage Demon Venerable made it and their lord only obtained it later, unlike Yellow Earth Great World’s Paradise Earth arrangement and Green Lotus Great World’s Genesis Lotus origin.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "savage-wilderness-counsel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "loc_green_lotus_great_world"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Longevity Heaven and Fang Yuan’s side attack Book Mountain’s four-way star formation, Gai Mei leads a group against the north formation and faces Zhou Xiong Xin and Jun Shen Guang. While Jiao Huo fights Zhou Xiong Xin evenly with a totem killer move, Gai Mei runs and dodges Jun Shen Guang, then grabs Jiao Huo’s shoulder and drags him away so Longevity Heaven’s groups return without result.",
      "chapters": [
        2178
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "four-way-star-assault",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_book_mountain",
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "char_jun_shen_guang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Bing Sai Chuan orders the Eight Extremities out of Calamity Luck Altar to attack Book Mountain, Heaven Extremity Gai Mei is named first among the eight who leave and activate the ancient battle formation Eight Extremities.",
      "chapters": [
        2182
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "eight-extremities-sortie",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
